# Doc Ock, Sinister Scientist (4/5, {4}{U}): "As long as there are eight or more cards in your graveyard, Doc Ock has base power and
# toughness 8/8." (CR 604.1, 613.4b.) T1 the five Moxen pay for him. T2 Bot2's Lightning Bolt (aimed at Bot1) lands in the OTHER graveyard.
# T3 Bot1 casts a Memnite and then Brain Freeze on itself with storm 1: two mills of three, so six cards plus Brain Freeze are seven
# in Bot1's graveyard - and with Bot2's Bolt eight cards between both, but he stays 4/5 (only "your graveyard" counts). T5 Bot1's
# own Lightning Bolt (aimed at Bot2) makes the eighth card in Bot1's graveyard: he is an 8/8, one more card than seven.

